# Optional LAN testing (no Cloudflare). Add to /etc/hosts on this Mac:
#
#   127.0.0.1  cases.local scan.local
#
# Then browse:
#   http://cases.local:8080  → we-testcase
#   http://scan.local:8080   → SecureScan
#
# Public internet still needs Cloudflare Tunnel + a real zone hostname.

127.0.0.1  cases.local scan.local
